WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
I'm the deputy of the state of Illinois at Black Panther Party 3 in Hampton.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
And we are going to have to fight, we're going to have to struggle.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.000
We're going to have to struggle relentlessly to bring about some peace.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
Because the people that we're acting for peace, they're a bunch of megalomaniac warm-mongers.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.000
And they don't even understand what these means.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
And we've got to fight them, we've got to struggle with them to make them understand what these means.

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
And we don't care what everybody says.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
We don't think it's paid five or five minutes because we think it's paid five or five minutes.

00:28.000 --> 00:31.000
We're going to fight racism, not racism, but we're going to fight this out there.

00:31.000 --> 00:35.000
We say we're not going to fight capitalism, we're black capitalism, but we're going to fight socialism.

00:35.000 --> 00:38.000
Why do I have a lot of risk because of harassment?

00:38.000 --> 00:39.000
Why is there harassment?

00:39.000 --> 00:47.000
Because the people that harass me have set up a problem that made me disagree with them violently.

00:47.000 --> 00:53.000
And they set up this problem in order to exploit me and other people like me.

00:53.000 --> 00:59.000
And why do they want to get rid of me because I'm saying something that might wake up some other exploited people and some other oppressed people.

00:59.000 --> 01:02.000
And if all these people ever get together, then these people today exploit.

01:02.000 --> 01:05.000
Unless we'll be running into the lake. That's why they want to get rid of us.

